-    /// One host CPU per vCPU, in vCPU order. Empty means no pins, and the
-    /// vCPUs share `cpu_affinity` instead.
+    /// Where each vCPU runs, in vCPU order: one host CPU (`8`), or a list of
+    /// them (`[8, 24]`, both threads of one core). Empty means no pins, and
